.TH SANCHALA-WEATHER 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-weather \- Beautiful weather forecasting application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-weather
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sanchala Weather provides elegant weather forecasting with current conditions,
7-day forecast, and hourly predictions using the Open-Meteo API.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B current, now
Show current weather for default or specified location
.TP
.B forecast, week
Show 7-day weather forecast
.TP
.B add \fIlocation\fR
Add a location to saved locations
.TP
.B list, ls
List saved locations
.TP
.B default \fIindex\fR
Set default location by index
.TP
.B units \fImetric|imperial\fR
Set temperature units
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Show current weather:
.B sanchala-weather current
.TP
Add a city:
.B sanchala-weather add "New York"
.TP
Show forecast for specific city:
.B sanchala-weather forecast Paris
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/sanchala/weather/config.json
User configuration file
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sanchala-nightlight (1)
